[9.322, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[9.326, "o", "\u001b[0;36m> using podman container \u00b7 asking opencode \u00b7 using deepseek-v4-flash-free\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[10.126, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build \u00b7 deepseek-v4-flash-free\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.926, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"SQL query optimization best practices and database performance tuning\"}\r\n"]
[11.144, "o", "\u001b[0m\u2699 \u001b[0mard-google-discovery_ard_search {\"query\":\"zero-trust security architecture design IAM access control\"}\r\n"]
[11.944, "o", "Here are the top tools I found for each need:\r\n\r\n**SQL Query Optimization**\r\n- **BigQuery SQL & Performance Guidelines** (skill, Tier 0, no auth) \u2014 SQL optimization, partitioning/clustering, window functions, schema design. Best match.\r\n- **Cloud SQL, AlloyDB & Spanner Database Design** (skill, Tier 0, no auth) \u2014 normalization, indexing, connection pooling, migration patterns.\r\n- **BigQuery / Cloud SQL / AlloyDB / Spanner MCP servers** (Tier 3, need GCP auth) \u2014 for actually executing/inspecting queries on live instances. Free tier available on BigQuery & Spanner.\r\n\r\n**Zero-Trust Security**\r\n- **Well-Architected Security Skill** (Tier 0, no auth) \u2014 zero-trust architecture, IAM least-privilege audit, network perimeters, encryption validation.\r\n- **Firebase Security Rules Skill** (Tier 0, no auth) \u2014 declarative security rules for Firestore/Realtime DB.\r\n- **Secret Manager MCP** (Tier 3, GCP auth) \u2014 secret rotation, IAM checks, audit logging.\r\n\r\n**Recommendation:** Start with the two Tier 0 skills (`bigquery-guidelines` + `database-design` for SQL, `well-architected-security` for zero-trust) \u2014 they run immediately with no auth. Add the BigQuery/Cloud SQL MCP servers later if you want to work against live databases.\r\n\r\nWant me to fetch the full skill docs for any of these?\r\n"]
